Tumor-Agnostic UMI Analysis - License and Usage Notice
=========================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains R and Python analysis code written by Alexandre
Matov for detecting colorectal neoplasm from ultra-deep targeted
sequencing data (the "tumor-agnostic UMI-seq" approach). Several scripts
call R packages (e.g. Bioconductor's deepSNV and shearwater) and personal
utility scripts (e.g. tools.R, sw_piles.R, duplex_tools.R,
recoder.R/auc.R/scaler.R/confusion_plot.R from a separate
"utility_functions" collection) that are NOT included in this repository
-- see README.md and DEPENDENCIES.md for details.

