4. Data files
--------------
`data/IMPROVEptList` and `data/201123_wes-spora-mutations-improve.csv`
contain patient-identifier-linked mutation/sample data from the IMPROVE
clinical trial cohort, included here as part of the research record
associated with the publication(s) cited in README.md. Any reuse of these
specific data files should also cite that publication.
